    [Test] Remove GLM vision NZ projection test (#20631)
    
    ### What this PR does / why we need it?
    
    The `singlecard_ops` suite is intended to validate custom operators
    implemented in vllm-ascend, such as those under `vllm_ascend/ops/triton`
    and `csrc`. The removed test exercises the GLM vision projection
    interface and the underlying CANN GEMM operator rather than a custom
    operator implemented in this repository, so it falls outside the scope
    of this suite.
    
    This is a test cleanup follow-up to #19564.
    
    ### Does this PR introduce _any_ user-facing change?
    
    No. This PR only removes a test file. No release note fragment is
    required.
    
    ### How was this patch tested?
    
    No tests were added as this PR only removes an existing test file.
    
    ---
    
    ### Checklist
    
    #### Testing
    
    - [ ] **Boundary / edge-case coverage**: Not applicable; no new behavior
    is introduced.
    - [ ] **Regression test**: Not applicable; this PR removes an
    out-of-scope test.
    - [ ] **Error / failure path coverage**: Not applicable; no error
    handling is changed.
    - [ ] **Meaningful & reliable tests**: No new tests are added; this
    cleanup aligns the suite with its intended scope.
    - [ ] **Performance impact**: Not applicable; no runtime implementation
    is changed.
    
